BEBPM for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of BEBPM 1.0.0 by CozyStudios.
Original source: https://www.curseforge.com/projects/1462757
Original licence: CC0-1.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (CC0-1.0); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the CC0-1.0 text (the jar names CC0-1.0 and has no licence file).
